00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:55.000
It was annoying. Once the strike was done, you might expect everyone quickly went back to their old commutes. But that didn't happen. When researchers looked at the data, they found that thousands of people stuck with new routines that they had invented during the strike. The chaos had helped many Londoners identify new and better ways of moving about the world. You can see where I'm going with this. Like those London commuters, you are grappling with a change to the normal rhythms and routines of

